<title>UK: National Australia Bank sets $250 mln bond.</title>
<headline>National Australia Bank sets $250 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL AUSTRALIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    26.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.915   PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FEES	 1.125     REOFFER    99.915    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA    LISTING    LUX     SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU/US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 DENOMS (K)  1-10-100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
